From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: My Workspace patches <claude@local>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 20:39:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] msggateway: bind inner requests to the connected user

The gateway only checked the outer envelope's sendID. Inner protobuf
requests carried their own userID, so any user could pull another
user's messages (1001/1002/1005/1006/1007) or send as another user
(1003). Bind the inner user to the connection, require sendID to be the
connected user, reject notification sessions and content types from
clients, and disable the unused signal path (1004).
